SYNOPSIS
.fg default
High 1024 over central Europe,
low 1004 over Cyprus moving E.
The meltemi (N winds) over the
Aegean strengthens through the
afternoon and peaks tonight.
.at 9
.fg yellow
OUTLOOK TO WED 03 SEP
.fg default
Gale 8 Kykladon, Ikario and
Karpathio from 1800, locally 9
over Ikario. Easing to 5-6 by
Wednesday noon. Ionian: fair.
